      "tip": "<b>S1a · Problem-space extraction (YAML node <code>s1-discovery</code>).</b> <b>researching-ba-problem-space</b> drafts a discovery artifact: problem framing · opportunities · the four product risks · regulatory regimes · a <b>proceed / needs-work / do-not-build</b> recommendation. <b>AI drafts; a named human decides</b> on that recommendation (the supervision gate). Only <b>proceed</b> releases S1b — <code>needs-work</code> loops back, <code>do-not-build</code> stops the pipeline. This gate is the irreversible-decision boundary, surfaced as its own card."
